# Magitek Scythe: entering, it attaches (its controller's choice) to Memnite, which becomes 3/2 with first strike and must be blocked
# this turn if able (CR 509.1c). Bot2's refusal to block is rejected; blocking with one Grizzly Bears is accepted and the first striker
# kills it unharmed. The requirement and first strike end with the turn: on turn 5 the Memnite (still equipped) is unblocked.

